{"id":"8f7b4f05c87cac5d04a56a8a53169bccbab89e9a","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/loudoun-county-virginia-data-center-alley-ai-boom-pause-2026-11","title":"America's data center capital is putting the brakes on new projects","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"Business Insider","byline":"Lauren Edmonds","excerpt":"Loudoun County in Virginia is the data center capital of the world. It's Board of Supervisors just paused new projects as it reviews its regulations.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n      \n            \n              <section id=\"post-headline\">\n                <h2>The county at the heart of America's data center boom hits pause on new projects</h2>\n            \n              </section>\n              \n              \n              \n                <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                          <p><span>By</span>\n                                  \n                                  \n                                  \n                                    <span data-e2e-name=\"Lauren Edmonds\">\n                                  \n                                      <span>\n                                        <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/lauren-edmonds\">Lauren Edmonds</a>        \n                                    <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"lauren-edmonds\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/lauren-edmonds\" data-topic-label=\"Lauren Edmonds\" data-topic-location=\"byline\" data-topic-shortened-label=\"Lauren\" data-topic-image=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;5ffdc615c8408b0019bd4117&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Lauren Edmonds Profile Photo&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1739,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Lauren Edmonds&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2319},&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;self&quot;:&quot;https://i.insider.com/5ffdc615c8408b0019bd4117&quot;}}\">\n                                      \n                                    \n                                      <div>\n                                        <p>\n                                            You're currently following this author!\n                                     Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                        </p>\n                                      </div>\n                                      \n                                    </span>\n                                      </span>\n                                    </span>  </p>\n                        </div>\n          </div><section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6b01d6c8d6c5d341c9b4bf25?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"Loudoun County in Virginia\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                            <details>\n                              <summary aria-label=\"Image caption\">\n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Nathan Howard/Bloomberg via Getty Images</span>              </summary>\n                              <span>Virginia's Loudoun County has the highest concentration of data centers in the world.</span>\n                            </details>\n                          </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            <div data-e2e-name=\"post-details\">\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                  <p><time data-timestamp=\"2026-11-21T18:43:15.906Z\" data-disable-relative-formatting=\"\">\n                      2026-11-21T18:43:15.906Z\n                    </time>\n                  </p>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                      <p>The Virginia county at the heart of <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/data-center-noise-disruptions-loudoun-county-virginia-2023-11\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">America's data center boom</a> has paused applications for a year.</p><p>Loudoun County's Board of Supervisors voted for a break on data center and electrical substation applications during a meeting earlier this week. <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/data-centers-northern-virginia-noise-air-pollution-cost-2025-5\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">Loudoun County</a> has the highest concentration of data centers in the world, which earned it the nickname \"Data Center Alley.\" Google and many other tech companies have facilities there.</p><p>The board said the pause will end once it decides on amendments to Loudoun County's comprehensive plan and zoning ordinance. The board initiated a review of its data center and electrical substation policies in February 2024.</p><p>\"The Board's reason for considering pausing action on legislative applications is to allow time for the county to complete the ongoing review of current data center policies and regulations,\" a press release from Loudoun County said.</p><p>The county said developers can continue to submit applications during the pause, and Loudoun County staff will continue to review them and schedule hearings with the planning commission. However, the board says there will be no public hearings or votes until the review is complete.</p><p>The decision could affect 33 active applications, according to the county.</p><p>Many US towns and cities have paused or outright banned large <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/data-center-bans-moratoriums-opposition-map-2026-6\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">data center projects</a> as residents debate their impact on communities. Supporters say new data center developments will create jobs and boost local economies. Critics are concerned about how they could affect the environment, utility costs, and their quality of life.</p><p>Despite support from the Trump administration and influential tech leaders, data centers proved deeply unpopular during the <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/data-centers-hammered-midterms-key-votes-show-how-2026-11\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">US midterm elections</a> earlier this month, playing a major role in ushering in a so-called \"blue wave\" of Democratic candidates.</p>\n                \n                \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section><section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6b01c0245d243d2af837ab1c\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&